#: templates/about.html:82
msgid ""
"A public-good ledger dashboard for the XRP Ledger. Free for retail users,"
" forever. A public-utility approach to ledger data: opinionated about "
"clarity, no token, no DEX, no upsells."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about.html:87
msgid "Launched: May 9, 2026."
msgstr "Lancé : 9 mai 2026."

#: templates/about.html:87
msgid ""
"We're live and actively smoothing out rough edges. If you spot something "
"that looks wrong or doesn't render right,"
msgstr ""

#: templates/about.html:88
msgid "tell us"
msgstr "dites-le nous"

#: templates/about.html:89
msgid "we'd rather hear it from you than ship around it."
msgstr "nous préférons l'entendre de vous plutôt que de contourner le problème."

#: templates/about.html:93
msgid "Mission"
msgstr "Mission"

#: templates/about.html:95
msgid ""
"Help XRP holders understand on-chain activity. Not get rich. Not sell "
"liquidity. Not push tokens. Just data, explained well, for people who "
"want to understand what they own."
msgstr ""

