"size cutoff is set just below), (2) anything touching a wallet we "
"recognize — exchanges, big projects, public companies, and (3) when one "
"of those recognized wallets starts holding a brand-new token. Even small "
"transactions show up if a recognized wallet is involved, because they're "
"often a clue about what big players are doing."
